{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47538","headline":"七言 四十七 · 吕岩","name":"七言 四十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"别来洛汭六东风，醉眼吟情慵不慵。\n摆撼乾坤金剑吼，烹煎日月玉炉红。\n杖摇楚甸三千里，鹤翥秦烟几万重。\n爲报晋成仙子道，再期春色会稽峰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47538.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47538","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}